    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/online-education-classes/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The Online Education Classes Theme is a contemporary and highly functional solution designed specifically for education-focused websites, encompassing e-learning platforms, online courses, virtual classrooms, tutoring centers, and higher education institutions. This theme is ideal for universities, colleges, online coaching academies, and skill development centers, as well as for certification programs, MOOC platforms, and EdTech startups. It supports a variety of educational initiatives, including corporate LMS, continuing education portals, teacher training institutes, and exam preparation apps, making it perfect for creating a dynamic learning environment. Whether you're building a portal for online learning, distance education, homeschooling, or interactive classes, this theme provides essential tools for course creation, lesson planning, student assessments, and progress tracking via seamless integration with LearnPress, Tutor LMS, and Contact Form 7. With its clean layout, responsive design, and intuitive navigation, the platform enhances online quizzes, academic calendars, virtual labs, video lectures, Zoom-powered live classes, webinars, eBooks, discussion forums, and downloadable study materials. Moreover, features such as customizable banners, dedicated student and teacher portals, schedule management, course enrollments, scholarship sections, and parent-teacher meeting tools are all optimized for speed, SEO, translations, and mobile responsiveness. Ultimately, the Online Education Classes Theme offers a professional and engaging platform for educators, tutors, training institutes, and e-learning businesses committed to delivering high-quality education online."
    },
